ADDITIONAL NOTICE ON LAWFUL USE

This software analyses public telephone numbering-plan data. It does not and
cannot determine the live geographic location of any device or person.

Use it only on telephone numbers that you own, or for which you hold prior
written authorisation from the owner. Using it to surveil, stalk, profile,
dox or harass any person is unlawful in most jurisdictions and is expressly
prohibited. The authors accept no liability for misuse.
